OL,3,GNEWSAAirport to increase the cost of
OL,4,Adrop-off charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Midlands Airport (EMA) is to
OL,7,Fincrease the cost of dropping off
OL,8,Fpassengers outside its terminal.
OL,10,FBosses said the charge for using its
OL,11,Frapid drop-off zone will rise from #5
OL,12,Ffor a 15-minute slot to #8 for a
OL,13,F10-minute stay from 15:00 BST on
OL,14,FTuesday.
OL,16,FThe airport said the move was in
OL,17,Fresponse to "significant inflationary
OL,18,Fpressures".
OL,20,FHowever, North West Leicestershire MP
OL,21,FAmanda Hack said the increase was
OL,22,Ffrustrating for consumers.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
